      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-13-001\" hidden></div>\n<h2 class=\"mm-heading mm-h2 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24308]\" style=\"background-color: #2F5496; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>1. </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>WHAT IS CLINICAL GOVERNANCE?</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong> </strong></span></h2>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24309]\" style=\"margin-top: 5pt; margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Clinical Governance is defined as a framework through which NHS organizations are accountable for continuously improving the quality of the services and safeguarding standards of the care by creating an environment in which excellence in the clinical care will flourish.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24310]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Traditionally, clinical governance has been described using 7 key pillars:\u00a0</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24311]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>clinical effectiveness and research\u00a0</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24312]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>clinical audit\u00a0</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24313]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>risk management\u00a0</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24314]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>education and training\u00a0</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24315]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>patient and public involvement (PPI)</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24316]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>information management\u00a0</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24317]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>staff management.\u00a0</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24318]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The various elements of clinical governance, when brought together,\u00a0acquire the ability to improve the efficiency of systems</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24319]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24320]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</p>",
